WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.341
Word families share end sounds; digraphs can appear at the beginning or end of words.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.760
Which word rhymes with sand? Answer: hand

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:14.509
Group words by a common rhyme, then write a sentence using a digraph word.

00:00:15.367 --> 00:00:18.481
Discuss why: Sand and hand share their final sound.
